ting only. Best content: Product demos + creator UGC + educational + testimonial + brand-story. In Manchester, YouTube reach + share of viewer time strong across all demographics."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the biggest Google Ads mistakes for diamond brands in Manchester?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"(1) Weak feed (missing attributes + poor titles + wrong category) — 30-60% revenue loss. (2) PMax without asset investment (default assets weak). (3) Same budget across all sub-categories/AOV tiers (should segment). (4) No brand-search campaign (competitors bid on your brand). (5) Ignoring feed disapprovals. (6) Optimising for first-purchase CPA vs LTV. (7) Weak Google Enhanced Conversions setup. (8) Ignoring YouTube for upper-funnel + retargeting. (9) No peak-season concentration (Wedding + Akshaya Tritiya + Dhanteras + Diwali (India), Ramadan + Eid + DSF + Dubai Jewellery Show (GCC), Christmas + Valentine's + engagement season (UK)). (10) Landing pages weak — Google traffic converts 40-60% higher when LPs optimised."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does Google Ads work with Meta Ads for a diamond brand?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Full-funnel synergy: (1) Meta drives awareness + discovery + retargeting + creator UGC amplification. (2) Google captures high-intent search + Shopping + brand + non-brand queries. (3) YouTube retargets Meta-attributed prospects. (4) WhatsApp CTWA (via Meta) closes high-AOV leads with Google-attributed brand-search visitors. Typical channel mix for Diamond + Solitaire in Manchester: Meta 40-50%, Google + Shopping + PMax 25-35%, TikTok/Snapchat/YouTube 10-15%, WhatsApp 5-10%. Attribution: Meta CAPI + Google Enhanced Conversions + WhatsApp CTWA + Shopify order-level + LTV/CAC/cohort dashboard (Triple Whale/Northbeam)."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do we track ROI for Google + Shopping + PMax for a diamond brand?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Weekly KPIs: total Google spend + ROAS by campaign type (brand + non-brand + Shopping + PMax + YouTube) + CAC + CPL + LTV/CAC + feed health + PMax asset performance. Monthly QBR: full P&L attribution + cohort LTV + Shopping vs PMax performance + creative + audience breakdown + next-month optimisation. Quarterly: cohort revenue attribution + LTV/CAC by cohort + peak-season readiness."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How does ITD manage Google + Shopping + PMax for a diamond brand in Manchester?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Full-stack: Merchant Center feed optimisation + Shopping campaigns + PMax + Brand Search + Non-brand Search + YouTube + Discovery + Enhanced Conversions API + LTV/CAC dashboard + weekly review + monthly QBR. Reference brands: Bluestone, CaratLane, Nakshatra, Solitaire (India); De Grisogono, Alhambra + high-end Dubai Gold Souk (GCC); Astley Clarke, Missoma engagement + Boodles + Graff (UK). Retainer £800-4,000/month + ad spend transparent pass-through. Free 30-min discovery call — we audit your Google Ads + Merchant Center + benchmark against 3-5 competing Manchester Diamond + Solitaire brands + share customised 90-day plan within 3 working days."}}]}</script>
