      <div class="itdgl-pm-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-pm-q">What Google Ads campaign structure works best for diamond brands?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-pm-a">Recommended structure for a Diamond + Solitaire brand: (1) Brand Search campaign (own brand + variants) — 6-15x ROAS, defensive against competitor bidding. (2) Non-brand Search (broad + phrase + exact match) — category + occasion + style + fit + material terms. (3) Shopping Standard — feed-driven product listing ads. (4) PMax — automated multi-channel. (5) YouTube Ads (Bumper + Skippable + In-feed) — awareness + retargeting. (6) Discovery + Demand Gen — cross-channel discovery. Allocation: 15-20% brand, 20-25% non-brand, 20-25% Shopping, 20-30% PMax, 5-10% YouTube, 5-10% Discovery.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-pm-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-pm-q">How much monthly Google + Shopping + PMax budget for a diamond brand?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-pm-a">In Manchester: £2,500-22,000/month total ad spend. Typical Google share: 25-35% of total performance marketing budget. Rule of thumb: 20-35% of monthly revenue during launch/growth phase. Peak season concentrates 40-60% annual spend in 12-16 weeks. Higher-AOV categories (diamond, luxury jewelry) support higher CPL breakeven — Google Search + Shopping justify premium CPL.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-pm-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-pm-q">How do we set up Google Enhanced Conversions + attribution?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-pm-a">Google Enhanced Conversions API essential — server-side event tracking recovers 15-25% attribution loss vs standard GA4. Setup: (1) Server-side via GA4 + Google Tag Manager server container OR (2) Direct Enhanced Conversions API integration via Shopify/backend. (3) Match Rate target: 85%+ (email/phone hash matching). (4) Combine with Meta CAPI + WhatsApp CTWA + Shopify order-level attribution. (5) LTV-weighted Value Bidding — import cohort LTV data via conversion value field. (6) Weekly attribution audit + monthly cohort review. Full-stack attribution drives 25-50% more efficient Google Ads scaling.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-pm-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-pm-q">What role does YouTube Ads play for a diamond brand?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-pm-a">YouTube Ads for Diamond + Solitaire: 5-15% of Google budget typical. Formats: (1) Bumper Ads (6 sec) — awareness + brand-recall priming. (2) Skippable In-Stream Ads (15-90 sec) — brand + product storytelling. (3) In-feed Video Ads — appear in YouTube search + Home page + Watch Next. (4) Shorts Ads (vertical video) — growing rapidly. (5) Non-skippable (15-30 sec) — high-frequency retargeting only. Best content: Product demos + creator UGC + educational + testimonial + brand-story. In Manchester, YouTube reach + share of viewer time strong across all demographics.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-pm-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-pm-q">What are the biggest Google Ads mistakes for diamond brands in Manchester?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-pm-a">(1) Weak feed (missing attributes + poor titles + wrong category) — 30-60% revenue loss. (2) PMax without asset investment (default assets weak). (3) Same budget across all sub-categories/AOV tiers (should segment). (4) No brand-search campaign (competitors bid on your brand). (5) Ignoring feed disapprovals. (6) Optimising for first-purchase CPA vs LTV. (7) Weak Google Enhanced Conversions setup. (8) Ignoring YouTube for upper-funnel + retargeting. (9) No peak-season concentration (Wedding + Akshaya Tritiya + Dhanteras + Diwali (India), Ramadan + Eid + DSF + Dubai Jewellery Show (GCC), Christmas + Valentine's + engagement season (UK)). (10) Landing pages weak — Google traffic converts 40-60% higher when LPs optimised.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-pm-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-pm-q">How does Google Ads work with Meta Ads for a diamond brand?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-pm-a">Full-funnel synergy: (1) Meta drives awareness + discovery + retargeting + creator UGC amplification. (2) Google captures high-intent search + Shopping + brand + non-brand queries. (3) YouTube retargets Meta-attributed prospects. (4) WhatsApp CTWA (via Meta) closes high-AOV leads with Google-attributed brand-search visitors. Typical channel mix for Diamond + Solitaire in Manchester: Meta 40-50%, Google + Shopping + PMax 25-35%, TikTok/Snapchat/YouTube 10-15%, WhatsApp 5-10%. Attribution: Meta CAPI + Google Enhanced Conversions + WhatsApp CTWA + Shopify order-level + LTV/CAC/cohort dashboard (Triple Whale/Northbeam).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-pm-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-pm-q">How do we track ROI for Google + Shopping + PMax for a diamond brand?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-pm-a">Weekly KPIs: total Google spend + ROAS by campaign type (brand + non-brand + Shopping + PMax + YouTube) + CAC + CPL + LTV/CAC + feed health + PMax asset performance. Monthly QBR: full P&L attribution + cohort LTV + Shopping vs PMax performance + creative + audience breakdown + next-month optimisation. Quarterly: cohort revenue attribution + LTV/CAC by cohort + peak-season readiness.</div>
      </div>
